            <div xml:id="d464">

                <pb facs="0598" n="590" xml:id="pg590"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">865.4016/60: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Phillips</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-09-08T11:00:00+01:00">September 8, 1938—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received September 8—8:45 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>228. My telegram No. 187, July 29, noon and my telegram No. 207, August 19, 6
                    p.m. We have informally requested information concerning various aspects of
                    recent anti-Semitic decrees as applicable to American citizens but have thus far
                    succeeded only in obtaining confirmation of assurances reported in my No. 207,
                    August 19.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
